Subject: [PATCH] Translations: add the Pico board mode texts in the 6
 languages

Keys of the texts shown by patches 0004 and 0007 (pico_text) added at the end
of the language files (de_DE, en_GB, es_ES, fr_FR, it_IT, nl_NL), section
"DARTSPICO-BRIDGE : CARTE PICO": card-pico, pico-ring-204, pico-ring-244-before,
pico-ring-244-after, pico-ring-none, pico-ring-question, pico-not-detected
({device}), pico-absent, pico-button-banned ({button}), pico-button-leds-sub,
pico-no-coins, pico-update-disabled. .mo files recompiled with msgfmt.
